## CoalesceBatchesExec with fetch
    CoalesceBatchesExec: target_batch_size=8192, fetch=10
      MockSourceExec: partitions=3, num_rows=Exact(600)
[invariant] A2 fetch_not_equal_cardinality at CoalesceBatchesExec (root): fetch() is Some(10), but cardinality_effect() is Equal; a fetch can drop input rows, so the effect should be LowerEqual while a fetch is set
[invariant] A8 partition_statistics_sum at CoalesceBatchesExec (root): overall num_rows is Exact(10), but the exact per-partition num_rows [10, 10, 10] sum to 30

